00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:05.800
Shipping in energy markets are closely watching developments in the waterway.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:10.740
Gulf states emphasize the importance of open navigation for global trade.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:14.980
Iranian officials maintain their right to regulate traffic in the area.

